F87FF]Link strategy frontmatter[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]schema[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema: add `link_reference` and `link_rendering` frontmatter to flat [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notes, web descriptors, and strands, with strand-over-web-over-default [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]precedence, validation, and `closure:` accepted as a legacy alias.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Link scanner and target resolver[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]scan[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]scan: add the `[\\[target]]` / `![\\[target]]` body scanner that skips code [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]zones, plus a resolver that maps a raw target onto a flat note, web [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]descriptor, or strand.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Links in the closure walk[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]closure[dim] · [dim][/dim]after schema, scan[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]closure: classify each detected link as an inline or reference edge from[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the effective strategies, feed inline edges into the existing BFS [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through `precomputed_spans`, add cross-unit inline targets as extra [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]roots, and make ACE strand relations follow the same rules.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Linked References output[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after closure[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: emit a numbered `## Linked References` section for every note [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and web unit across the markdown, rich, and json formats, and carry link[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]data in the JSON payloads.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Declare existing web strategies[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]migrate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]migrate: state `glossary`'s implicit/inline strategies explicitly, drop [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the legacy `closure:` key from in-repo descriptors, and report [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unresolved links as doctor and init warnings.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Generated task-type strand links[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]taskgen[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]taskgen: make the generated task-type strands emit a Related Task Types [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section linking every other catalog type their own prose names.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Link the existing corpus[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]content[dim] · [dim][/dim]after migrate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]content: add links across the hand-authored notes and strands that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]already cross-reference each other in prose, and record the decision [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that supersedes the \"not a new, parallel link syntax\" clause of the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory-webs record.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Skill and documentation updates[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after migrate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: teach `/sase_memory_write` to author links, and document the two [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strategies in `docs/memory.md` and the generated memory README.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-vw","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-vw.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7bdedebe0f650790c316187ab9795155","started_at":"2026-08-30T14:04:06.162023+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1788108050,"sha":"70dd1da6174fe18fa264d5cbf1247daaaf88e8df","subject":"feat(memory): declare existing web link strategies"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"11d378d37e6d69f5cbf9f572fde613e1eef8415d1d550bda6a03209e0d0663eb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vw.5/chat.md","size_bytes":4133},"commits":{"digest":"397edbbb2c68de41c09de0fe89fe78f1c06867de7a045cb436000af54fe1a6b5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vw.5/commits.json","size_bytes":228},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vw.5/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"d160e001c2f108b115d908efaab1eae02043882aab32b6523aa1bbf49137ce3d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vw.5/meta.json","size_bytes":632},"prompt":{"digest":"d13f2388cb4db87ad0f71b4b5443b8aebd71a6718d747026549cf43d1d2d88c5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vw.5/prompt.md","size_bytes":140},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"975d199d19ada0157783fbff99d197e2e8f0218ec4f0193f824d1d4c165702be","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vw.5/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":8280},"state":{"digest":"71dad8ea9e98d0ff24c0e7da76ba7deb148ee3482155d808af3ad18cfdaa9f76","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vw.5/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-08-30T16:41:51.830063+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-vw.5","local_name":"sase-vw.5","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-vw","agent_clan_generation":"20260830100344","approve":true,"bead_id":"